5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I am Asuka. I will focus on logical consistency and identify contradictions in your statements.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Takumi here. I’m ready to fight. Let’s find the wolf and protect our friends.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I’m Mio. I’m so excited to start this adventure with you all!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,Shion. I observe. I calculate. I will guide us to the truth with cold precision.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,Minako. I will remain calm and analyze the facts. Let’s proceed with discipline and care.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Takumi, your enthusiasm is noted. However, emotion often clouds judgment. We need data, not hype.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,@Asuka I’m not just hype! I’m serious. We need to be strong together to win.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi That’s so brave! I agree, we should stick together and support each other!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio Support is inefficient. We need isolation of variables. Watch your words, Mio.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,@Shion Isolation is risky. We need balance. Let’s listen to everyone before judging.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Minako, balance is a virtue, but in logic, ambiguity is the enemy. Be precise.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako I hear you. But if we wait too long, the wolf strikes. We must act.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka I’m just trying to keep the mood light! Don’t be so strict, please!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,@Asuka Agreed. Emotion is noise. I will filter it out. The wolf hides in the chaos.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,@Asuka I understand. I will be precise. But we must not let fear dictate our actions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Understood. Let us proceed to the night. I will analyze the results upon waking.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Okay. Let’s hope we get some good info tonight. I’m ready for anything.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mio,,Goodnight everyone! I hope we find the wolf soon. I’m a little nervous!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shion,,Sleep. I will be watching. The night reveals what the day conceals.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Minako,,Goodnight. I will rest and prepare my mind for the analysis tomorrow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
