31,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The Seer has spoken. The result is known. Let us discuss the implications logically.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Who did the Seer check? I need to know who is safe and who is dangerous.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mio,,@Takumi I’m sure the Seer knows best! Let’s trust the process and stay positive!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shion,,I checked Takumi. He is human. The wolf is among the remaining three.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Minako,,@Shion You are the Seer? That changes the dynamic. Let’s verify your claim carefully.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion If you are the Seer, your claim is strong. But why check Takumi first?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Takumi,,@Shion Thanks for checking me! I knew I was safe. Now let’s find the real wolf.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shion Wow, you’re the Seer! That’s amazing! I’m so glad you’re on our side!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka Takumi was the most vocal. I needed to eliminate the obvious. Now, who is lying?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Minako,,@Shion Vocal doesn't mean safe. But your logic holds. Let’s look at the others' reactions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Asuka,,@Minako Reactions are data. Takumi’s relief is expected. Mio’s excitement is typical. Shion’s calm is consistent.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Takumi"",""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Takumi,,@Asuka I’m just relieved! I’m not hiding anything. Let’s vote for the one who seems off.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi I’m just happy! I don’t know what to do, I’m so confused by all this!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mio Confusion is a sign of innocence, or a mask. I suspect Asuka. Her logic is too perfect.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Minako,,@Shion Suspecting Asuka is bold. But her precision is suspicious. Let’s weigh the evidence.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion My logic is not a mask. It is a tool. If you are the Seer, trust your divination.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Takumi,,@Asuka I trust you too. But Shion’s suspicion is strong. We need to be careful.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mio,,@Shion I don’t think Asuka is the wolf! She’s just smart! Please don’t vote for her!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shion,,@Mio I do not vote on emotion. I vote on probability. Asuka’s control is a threat.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Minako,,@Shion I agree with Asuka’s caution. But I will not vote without more proof. Let’s see.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
