64,2,1,talk,Mio,,Oh no! Asuka is gone! And Takumi was attacked! This is so scary!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Shion,,Asuka was executed. Takumi is dead. The wolf is among Minako or me. I am the Seer.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Minako,,"@Shion You claim to be the Seer. But you voted for Asuka, who was logical. Why?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Mio,,@Minako I’m so sad! We lost two people! We need to be careful now!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Shion,,@Minako Asuka was a threat. Her logic was a facade. You are the last suspect.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion A facade? I was calm. You were aggressive. Let’s look at the facts, not feelings.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Mio,,@Shion I think you’re right! Asuka was too cold! Let’s trust the Seer!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mio Trust is a luxury. I have the data. Minako, your silence is suspicious.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Minako,,@Shion Silence is not guilt. It is thought. You are the only one with power. Prove it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Mio,,@Minako I don’t know what to do! I’m just a villager! Please help me!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
